OL,3,GNEWSADads have to go back to work too
OL,4,Asoon after babies born, families say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disabled mum from Greater Manchester
OL,7,Fhas joined a campaign for better
OL,8,Fpaternity leave after being "stopped in
OL,9,Fher tracks" by the challenges of
OL,10,Fadapting to motherhood alone.
OL,12,FMelissa Johns, 36, from
OL,13,FAshton-under-Lyne, welcomed her first
OL,14,Fchild in October.
OL,16,FDespite requiring six weeks to recover
OL,17,Ffrom a caesarean section, Melissa - who
OL,18,Fwas born without a fully formed right
OL,19,Farm - was left to face maternity leave
OL,20,Falone after her partner went back to
OL,21,Fwork when their daughter was two weeks
OL,22,Fold.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
