OL,3,GNEWSADads have to go back to work too
OL,4,Asoon after babies born, families say
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has now joined a campaign to change
OL,7,Fthe law to let fathers take longer
OL,8,Fpaternity leave, and to receive a
OL,9,Fbigger proportion of their salary when
OL,10,Fthey do.
